Note on table1.dat: The evolutionary/spectral classes correspond to the
 categories adopted throughout this work. Signal-to-noise ratios are given for
 the Y, J, and H bands. The entry labelled Sun corresponds to the solar
 reference spectrum.
Note on table2.dat: For the SiI 10786.849A and SrII 10036.653A features
 in the Y band across the representative stars used in this work. The entry
 labelled Sun corresponds to the solar reference spectrum.
Note on atomich.dat and atomicj.dat and atomicy.dat: Blank entries indicate
 that the corresponding quantity was not available or was not measured for
 that transition in that spectral type.
